            <ArticleTitle>A tuberculosis case mimicking lymphoma.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>157</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.11604/pamj.2014.17.157.3192</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Tuberculosis remains a worldwide health problem causing morbidity and mortality. Abdominal tuberculosis is a rare form of the disease. Abdominal form of tuberculosis can mimic other non-infectious diseases. In this report, we presented an abdominal tuberculosis presenting with an intra-abdominal mass lesion and multiple lymphadenopathies that mimics lymphoma.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
